&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Mark43 law enforcement platform delivers mission-critical services to agencies across the country. When our systems are unavailable, real-world safety is impacted. As a Platform Engineer, you will take ownership of critical platform capabilities that ensure our systems are reliable, scalable, and equally important: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;enable engineers to build, deploy, and&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;software with speed and confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you will&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;at the intersection of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;platform engineering and developer experience (DevEx)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. You will design and evolve internal platforms as&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, reducing friction across the software development lifecycle while&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;strong standards for reliability, security, and compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;While this role includes opportunities to work on observability systems,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;prior experience in observability platforms is not&amp;nbsp;required&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we value engineers who can learn quickly and apply strong platform fundamentals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll use tools like Terraform, Kubernetes, Helm, ArgoCD, and DataDog to build scalable platform primitives and improve developer workflows across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
