&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced product leader with a track record of leading complex software products and developing high-performing teams. You should have significant product management experience, including several years leading Product Managers and working closely with Design and Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated experience taking complex products from strategy through delivery and adoption. You are equally comfortable discussing a long-term market opportunity with an executive, exploring workflows with an end user, and working through product and technical trade-offs with a delivery team. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You have a strong bias towards execution and know how to translate strategy into priorities, establish accountability, remove blockers, and keep teams focused on delivering results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise SaaS, government technology, policing, public safety, or similarly complex and regulated environments is highly valuable. Familiarity with AI-enabled products, data-rich workflows, or modern approaches to software design and development is also beneficial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
