&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work across the full stack, building the software that UK police custody&amp;nbsp;suites depend on&amp;nbsp;every day. Our team owns features end-to-end, from database migration to UI, so&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;get broad exposure regardless of your starting point. Our stack includes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:150}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
