&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manager of Revenue Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to join our Finance &amp;amp; Accounting team as an individual contributor. This role sits at the center of our quote-to-cash architecture and serves as the financial owner of the revenue across our operational systems. You will combine deep technical accounting expertise with strong business systems judgment to ensure complex SaaS and Professional Services arrangements are structured, allocated, billed, and recognized accurately at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
