&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work for any employer in the country in which the role is being hired. We are unable to sponsor or take over sponsorship of an employment visa at this time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mark43&#39;s mission is to empower communities and their governments with technology that improves the safety and quality of life for all. We build powerful, scalable software that sets a new standard for the tools first responders rely on every day. Our users are diverse, and we are committed to embracing diversity of thought, experience, and perspective across our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Financial Analyst, FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;join our Finance team. Reporting to the Senior Manager, FP&amp;amp;A,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;play a key role in helping leaders across the company make informed business decisions through thoughtful planning, forecasting, and financial analysis.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;llpartner with teams throughout the organization, develop insights that influence strategy, and help build scalable financial processes as Mark43 continues to grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone who has built a strong analytical foundation within either a larger, process-oriented organization or an early-stage company that has scaled&amp;nbsp;quickly, and&amp;nbsp;is excited to bring that rigor to a fast-moving software company.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;have broad visibility across the business, meaningful ownership, and the opportunity to help shape how Finance supports the company&#39;s next stage of growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
