&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you were part of our team, here are some things you would&amp;nbsp;do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
